    ],
    "text": "THE LAND ACQUISITION ACT, (CHAPTER 460) Notice under Section 7 My No.: \u0db6/\u0d89/1/3/1. Land Mini. No.: 03/J/86/HA/346. I hereby give Notice under Sub-section (1) of Section 7 of the Land Acquisition Act, that the Government intends to acquire the following lands which is required Badalkumbura Divisional Secretariat. Description of the land to be acquired: Allotments of Land in F.V.P 210, Suppliment No. 14, Sheet No. 17 Prepared by the Superintendant Surveyor in Monaragla, situated in Alupotha Village in the Badalkumbura Divisional Secretary\u2019s Division of the District of Monaragala in Uva Province described as follows. 01. Lot No. 353",
